::error file=domain/entities.go,line=23,col=2,title=E018 multiple Go fields map to one PostgreSQL column::domain.Item.Alt and domain.Item.Label both map to public.items.label%0A%0Atwo fields over one column disagree on every write, and reading fills both with the same value%0A%0AFix: point Alt at another column with orm:"column:<name>", or exclude it with orm:"-"
::error file=domain/entities.go,line=5,col=1,title=E017 multiple Go entities map to one PostgreSQL table::domain.User and domain.Account both map to public.users%0A%0Aone table has one identity, one set of writable columns and one set of relations; two entities over it would disagree about all three%0A%0AFix: map domain.User to its own table, or remove one of the two entities
